# The #5289 shape: the swap replaces whatever the alias resolves to, not the
# captured source.
MODULE: SupersededPublicationRefusedSwapUnfenced
TARGET: SupersededPublicationRefused
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: the swap is fenced only on the alias read just before it (#5289)
PERTURBS: CutSwap

--- FIND
    /\ phase = "Cutover" /\ cstep = 1 /\ alias \in {srcPhys, dest}
--- REPLACE
    /\ phase = "Cutover" /\ cstep = 1
--- END
